          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for that is his only covering, it is his garment for his skin: wherein shall he sleep? and it shall come to pass, when he crieth unto me, that I will hear; for I am gracious.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not revile God, nor curse a ruler of thy people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not delay to offer of thy harvest, and of the outflow of thy presses. The first-born of thy sons shalt thou give unto me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likewise shalt thou do with thine oxen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with thy sheep: seven days it shall be with its dam; on the eighth day thou shalt give it me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye shall be holy men unto me: therefore ye shall not eat any flesh that is torn of beasts in the field; ye shall cast it to the dogs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
